        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2E7D32&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; shipped / repository-side complete&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; next major architecture&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Priority rule:&lt;/b&gt; security, data-loss prevention, and stable-workflow regressions may move roadmap features. Version boxes describe exit outcomes, not dates." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cccccc;" vertex="1" parent="1">
